{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nFoundation for the Projects page, following the CLAUDE.md \"How to add a page\" checklist.\n\n## Spec\n- `page \"projects\"` in `assets/default.kdl`, `\"7\" \"page:projects\"` in `app { }`, `projects` appended to the builtin `pages` list; `build_pages` arm; loader accessor + test\n- Permission check on first activation: `gh auth status` must include the `project` scope (or the first `gh project` call fails with a scope error) → render a one-line notice (\"gh needs the project scope: run `gh auth refresh -s project`\") instead of the panes; missing `gh` reuses the GitHub page's \"not available\" notice\n- Background fetch via an `mpsc` channel drained in `drain_background()`; disk cache for the project list and the last board (reuse `src/github/domain/disk_cache.rs`)\n- Module layout `src/projects/{mod.rs, page.rs, state.rs, domain/{mod.rs, client.rs, types.rs}, panes/{mod.rs, projects.rs, board.rs, detail.rs}}`\n\nPart of #119.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T08:11:56Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":120,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: page skeleton"}
